(Head-head TWP state demo)
(Uses the prototype TWP M-codes only; this does not yet change motion interpretation.)
G17 G21 G40 G49 G54 G61 G80 G90 G94
G0 X1500.000 Y850.000 Z-600.000 B45.000 C90.000
M152 (Set TWP origin and orientation from current tool pose)
M156 P0.0 (Set plane-normal rotation)
M153 (Activate TWP state)
M0 (Inspect headheadtwp pins: origin, BC, active)
M154 (Cancel TWP)
M155 (Reset TWP definition)
M2
%
